      "text": [
        "391 - وَقَالَ أَمِيرُ اَلْمُؤْمِنِينَ عَلَيْهِ اَلسَّلاَمُ: «يَغْسِلُ اَلْمَيِّتَ أَوْلَى اَلنَّاسِ بِهِ أَوْ مَنْ يَأْمُرُهُ اَلْوَلِيُّ بِذَلِكَ."
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.391 - The Commander of the Faithful Imam Ali ibn Abi Talib (as) said:\n\"The one who washes the deceased should be the closest person to them or the one whom the guardian (Wali) of the deceased appoints for this task.\""
        ]
      }
